        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Throne of Garnoc.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King of Garnoc died without an heir. Lords are fighting for the throne. Create your own unique deck of cards and units, battle tough lords and become the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Castle Merchant</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The merchant is one of the most reliable stops along your journey. At the merchant, you can buy cards, troops, imperial legacies, potions, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/0f6906561d760ae94b853e14e215b85e.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/0f6906561d760ae94b853e14e215b85e.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/0f6906561d760ae94b853e14e215b85e.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Molgard, A Forgotten Empire</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molgrad... It was once a magnificent empire. However, when and how it fell is not even recorded in history books. Though the Molgrad Empire has vanished from the stage of history, it left behind legendary legacies that still maintain their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/46cf983beb64db7d45559212f9185210.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/46cf983beb64db7d45559212f9185210.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/46cf983beb64db7d45559212f9185210.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Blacksmith's Hammer.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can be upgraded in two ways at the blacksmith. Card Level increases the damage the card deals, while Position Level allows the card to target multiple enemies simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/21730d139a565656a7e6f52f545a93b3.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/21730d139a565656a7e6f52f545a93b3.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/21730d139a565656a7e6f52f545a93b3.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Secret Tactics of War</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies and become king in this game using unique cards for each character. You can change the enemy's formation with the Position Change card. The Unit Change card randomly swaps your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Don't forget to add &quot;Conquer Lands&quot; to your Steam wishlist!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
