 formation with the Position Change card. The Unit Change card randomly swaps your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/bd003953239a3d322b7ae777e5d1983d.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Don't forget to add &quot;Conquer Lands&quot; to your Steam wishlist!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.poster.avif?t=1776678416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.webm?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906660/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.mp4?t=1776678416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
